<Feedback_Loops>
├── <Loop_1:_Selection_for_Resonance>
│   ├── <resonant_text> [gets] <distribution>
│   └── <distribution> [incentivizes] <more_resonant_text>
├── <Loop_2:_Slop_Discourse_as_Fuel>
│   ├── <slop_complaints> [generate] <attention>
│   └── <attention> [selects_for] <more_discourse_and_more_production>
└── <Loop_3:_Credential_and_Certainty>
    ├── <uncertainty> [raises] <status_signaling>
    └── <status_signaling> [selects_for] <performative_certainty_over_verification>
